這裡為你將原本的瑪利歐懷舊像素風格，全面改造為「薑餅人王國／餅乾大冒險 (Cookie Run Style)」風格！

### ✨ 風格改造重點：

1. **整體配色**：採用烘焙烤餅乾的暖黃色、糖霜牛奶白、薑餅棕色、草莓糖漿紅與抹茶綠。
2. **視覺細節**：
* 卡片邊框改為**糖霜波浪與糖果按鈕結構**（圓潤且厚實的立體感）。
* HUD 頂欄變成**王國資源列**（麵包粉、水晶、香草糖果粒、冒險關卡數）。
* 水晶（CRYSATLS）與香草（VANILLA）圖示加上了閃爍與擺動動畫。


3. **動態互動**：
* 解鎖卡片 Hover 時會有可愛的 Q 彈縮放與黃金烤色效果。
* 上鎖卡片改為**未烤熟的巧克力餅乾麵糰質感**，點擊時跳出「餅乾還在烤箱裡！」Toast 提示。



可以直接複製下方完整 Code 貼上至你的 HTML 檔案或 CodePen 運行：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PLAYER 1 - 餅乾勇士的網頁開發冒險作品集</title>
    <!-- 引入可愛圓潤與遊戲感字體 -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;700&family=Mochiy+Pop+One&family=Zen+Maru+Gothic:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* =========================================================
           1. 薑餅人王國主題色彩與全域變數 (Cookie Run Palette)
           ========================================================= */
        :root {
            --ginger-bg: #FFF5E4;         /* 暖白麵粉背景 */
            --ginger-crust: #C68B59;      /* 薑餅香烤主色 */
            --ginger-dark: #8B4513;       /* 濃郁巧克力棕 */
            --ginger-light: #FFC069;      /* 奶油金黃色 */
            --icing-white: #FFFFFF;       /* 糖霜純白 */
            --candy-red: #FF4D6D;         /* 草莓糖漿紅 */
            --matcha-green: #52B788;      /* 抹茶草地綠 */
            --crystal-blue: #4EA8DE;      /* 水晶糖果藍 */
            --text-cookie: #4A2810;       /* 餅乾主要文字（深焦糖） */
            --border-radius-lg: 24px;
            --border-radius-md: 16px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Zen Maru Gothic', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--ginger-bg);
            /* 糖果點點背景圖案 */
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(#FFE3BB 18%, transparent 18%),
                radial-gradient(#FFE3BB 18%, transparent 18%);
            background-size: 30px 30px;
            background-position: 0 0, 15px 15px;
            color: var(--text-cookie);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 16px 40px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           2. HUD 遊戲頂列資源列 (Resources Bar)
           ========================================================= */
        .hud-bar {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 960px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            background-color: #5C3D2E;
            border: 4px solid #3D2314;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #2A160A, inset 0 3px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #FFF;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .hud-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .hud-icon {
            font-size: 18px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hud-label {
            color: #FFD93D;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .hud-value {
            color: #FFF;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* 水晶與香草閃耀動畫 */
        .crystal-anim {
            animation: crystalGlow 1.5s infinite alternate;
        }
        @keyframes crystalGlow {
            from { transform: scale(1); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 2px #4EA8DE); }
            to { transform: scale(1.15); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px #90E0EF); }
        }

        /* =========================================================
           3. 餅乾勇士 個人卡片 (Profile Hero Section)
           ========================================================= */
        .profile-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 960px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF9F2 0%, #FFEFC8 100%);
            border: 4px solid var(--ginger-dark);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            gap: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 0 var(--ginger-dark), 0 15px 20px rgba(74, 40, 16, 0.15);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* 卡片頂部糖霜邊飾 */
        .profile-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 12px;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                -45deg,
                var(--icing-white),
                var(--icing-white) 15px,
                var(--candy-red) 15px,
                var(--candy-red) 30px
            );
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ginger-dark);
        }

        .avatar-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 110px;
            height: 110px;
            background: #FFD97D;
            border: 4px solid var(--ginger-dark);
            border-radius: 50%;
            padding: 6px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .avatar-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .player-title {
            font-family: 'Mochiy Pop One', 'Zen Maru Gothic', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--ginger-dark);
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #FFF;
        }

        .player-subtitle {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #7A5230;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-top: 4px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           4. 關卡選擇區塊標題 (Stage Select Header)
           ========================================================= */
        .section-title {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 960px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-family: 'Mochiy Pop One', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--ginger-dark);
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #FFF, 4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .candy-star {
            font-size: 24px;
            animation: bounceStar 1s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes bounceStar {
            from { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-10deg); }
            to { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(10deg); }
        }

        /* =========================================================
           5. 網格卡片區排版 (16 Stage Grid)
           ========================================================= */
        .stage-grid {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 960px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* 餅乾卡片基礎樣式 */
        .stage-card {
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            min-height: 135px;
            padding: 16px;
            position: relative;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
            border: 4px solid var(--ginger-dark);
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* 解鎖卡片 (美味金黃烤餅乾樣式) */
        .stage-card.unlocked {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFDD83 0%, #E8A752 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--ginger-dark), 0 10px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .stage-card.unlocked:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 0 var(--ginger-dark), 0 16px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFE89C 0%, #F5B865 100%);
        }

        .stage-card.unlocked:active {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--ginger-dark);
        }

        /* 未解鎖卡片 (未烤熟巧克力餅乾麵糰樣式) */
        .stage-card.locked {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9C8375 0%, #685044 100%);
            border-color: #3D2B22;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #2A1C16;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .stage-card.locked:hover {
            animation: cookieShake 0.4s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes cookieShake {
            0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            25% { transform: rotate(-3deg); }
            75% { transform: rotate(3deg); }
        }

        /* 卡片頁首與 Badge */
        .stage-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .stage-number {
            color: var(--ginger-dark);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .locked .stage-number {
            color: #E2D4C9;
        }

        .stage-badge {
            padding: 3px 8px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 2px solid var(--ginger-dark);
        }

        .unlocked .stage-badge {
            background-color: var(--matcha-green);
            color: #FFF;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .locked .stage-badge {
            background-color: #4A352B;
            color: #C2B2A3;
            border-color: #2A1C16;
        }

        .stage-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 12px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .unlocked .stage-title {
            color: var(--ginger-dark);
            text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
        }

        .locked .stage-title {
            color: #D3C4B7;
        }

        .lock-icon {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-right: 2px;
        }

        /* =========================================================
           6. 上鎖關卡提示框 (Cookie Run Styled Toast)
           ========================================================= */
        .toast {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(100px);
            background-color: var(--candy-red);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border: 4px solid var(--ginger-dark);
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--ginger-dark), 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275), opacity 0.3s ease;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 100;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .toast.show {
            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* 響應式佈局適應 */
        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .stage-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 12px 10px 30px;
            }
            .stage-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 14px;
            }
            .hud-bar {
                font-size: 11px;
                padding: 10px 8px;
            }
            .hud-item {
                padding: 4px 8px;
            }
            .player-title {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HUD 頂欄 (薑餅人王國資源列) -->
    <div class="hud-bar">
        <div class="hud-item">
            <span class="hud-icon">🥐</span>
            <div>
                <div class="hud-label">EXP FLOUR</div>
                <div class="hud-value">9,999</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hud-item">
            <span class="hud-icon crystal-anim">💎</span>
            <div>
                <div class="hud-label">CRYSTALS</div>
                <div class="hud-value">3,200</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hud-item">
            <span class="hud-icon">🌿</span>
            <div>
                <div class="hud-label">VANILLA</div>
                <div class="hud-value">WORLD 1</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hud-item">
            <span class="hud-icon">🏆</span>
            <div>
                <div class="hud-label">CLEAR</div>
                <div class="hud-value">02/16</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 餅乾勇士個人資料卡 -->
    <div class="profile-card">
        <div class="avatar-container">
            <!-- 薑餅人風格預設大頭貼 -->
            <img class="avatar-img" src="https://placehold.co/100x100/FFC069/8B4513?text=COOKIE" alt="Cookie Hero Avatar" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/100x100/8B4513/FFF?text=COOKIE'">
        </div>
        <div>
            <h1 class="player-title">🍪 勇敢餅乾的 Web 冒險記</h1>
            <p class="player-subtitle">歡迎來到我的網頁開發冒險地圖！收集糖霜解鎖全 16 個課堂挑戰關卡吧！</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 關卡選擇區塊 Header -->
    <div class="section-title">
        <span class="candy-star">⭐</span>
        <span>SELECT STAGE</span>
        <span class="candy-star">⭐</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 16 關卡薑餅卡片牆 -->
    <div class="stage-grid">

        <!-- Stage 1 (Unlocked) -->
        <a href="w1/index.html" class="stage-card unlocked">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 01</span>
                <span class="stage-badge">CLEARED!</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 1 - 數位名片</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 2 (Unlocked) -->
        <a href="w2/index.html" class="stage-card unlocked">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 02</span>
                <span class="stage-badge">CLEARED!</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 2 - 今天吃甚麼?</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 3 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(3)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 03</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 3 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 4 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(4)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 04</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 4 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 5 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(5)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 05</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 5 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 6 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(6)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 06</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 6 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 7 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(7)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 07</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 7 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 8 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(8)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 08</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 8 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 9 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(9)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 09</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 9 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 10 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(10)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 10</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 10 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 11 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(11)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 11</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 11 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 12 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(12)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 12</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 12 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 13 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(13)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 13</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 13 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 14 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(14)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 14</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 14 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 15 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(15)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 15</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 15 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

        <!-- Stage 16 (Locked) -->
        <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="stage-card locked" onclick="showLockedMessage(16)">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">STAGE 16</span>
                <span class="stage-badge"><span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>BAKING...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stage-title">Week 16 - 尚未解鎖</div>
        </a>

    </div>

    <!-- 上鎖關卡提示浮動 Toast -->
    <div id="toast" class="toast">
        <span>🍪</span>
        <span id="toast-text">關卡還在烤箱裡烘烤中！</span>
    </div>

    <script>
        let toastTimeout;

        // 觸發薑餅人風格 Toast 提示
        function showLockedMessage(weekNum) {
            const toast = document.getElementById('toast');
            const toastText = document.getElementById('toast-text');
            
            toastText.innerText = `STAGE ${weekNum} 餅乾還在烤箱裡烘烤中！敬請期待！`;
            toast.classList.add('show');

            clearTimeout(toastTimeout);
            toastTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
                toast.classList.remove('show');
            }, 2500);
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>

```
